# Per-game tooling owns its own .gitignore (e.g. cogfall/.gitignore handles
# node_modules, dist preservation, .vite, tsconfig.tsbuildinfo). This root
# file is just for OS / editor cruft that can leak in from any contributor.

# Agent session state (Claude Code and similar harnesses drop per-session
# dirs here). Same category as .vscode/ / .idea/ above — never commit.
**/.claude/
